   "source": "\"\"\"Factoring baseline: plain trial division over odd candidates in a Python loop. Deterministic; cost ~ the smaller factor.\"\"\"\n\n\ndef solve(n):\n    if n % 2 == 0:\n        return 2\n    d = 3\n    while d * d <= n:\n        if n % d == 0:\n            return d\n        d += 2\n    return n  # n is prime: no nontrivial divisor (the verifier rejects this, which is correct)\n",
